_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T09:26:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T09:26:44Z","body":"Hi #74236 seems unrelated to the other issue except for the fact that they are in the same part of the editor if so please make a separate PR to fix it","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4573183090/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4577743051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119617#issuecomment-4577743051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119617","id":4577743051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABENrQyw","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T16:58:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T16:58:10Z","body":"> Hi https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74236 seems unrelated to the other issue except for the fact that they are in the same part of the editor if so please make a separate PR to fix it\r\n\r\nIt is related, unfortunately. \"Change Type\" (along with the others) requires the new `_validate_no_foreign_selected()` to prevent editing foreign child nodes in the selection.\r\n\r\nBut I plan to split this into separate PRs (one per issue) once I get everything fixed and tested (would require duplicating some shared changes). Thanks for the reminder though.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tcase TOOL_CHANGE_TYPE: {\r\n\t\t\tif (!profile_allow_editing) {\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tList<Node *> full_selection = editor_selection->get_full_selected_node_list();\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif (!_validate_no_foreign_selected(full_selection)) { // New\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif (!_validate_no_instance_selected(full_selection)) { // New\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4577743051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4585549487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119617#issuecomment-4585549487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119617","id":4585549487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEVHurw","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T03:09:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T06:17:43Z","body":"Triple checked all the related code and locally tested all the new code, finally!\r\nWill split this into smaller, more focused PRs.\r\n\r\nBug triage results:\r\n- Confusing `selection` with `full_selection` in `scene_tree_dock.cpp`.\r\n- Misusing `get_top_selected_node_list()` for `get_full_selected_node_list()`.\r\n- Incorrect usage of `_validate_no_foreign()`, `_validate_no_instance()` to check `full_selection`.\r\n\r\nSplit PRs:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119908\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119909\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119910","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR"